Sval: Remove about:unloads, about:inference, about:checkerboard and about:pdf

no-closed-about-pages.patch takes each name out of the about: redirect
tables, so nothing opens these pages. Their components go with them:
the directories and their build entries, about:pdf's window actor, its
remote page permissions and its async pref, the Fluent files only they
read, the Kit illustration only about:pdf's promo drew, and their tests.
TabUnloader itself, in tabbrowser, stays.

